ential eligibility for housing assistance for disabled veterans by preventing disability compensation from counting against low- and moderate-income thresholds.","evidence":"when determining whether a person is a person of low and moderate income... shall exclude any service-connected disability compensation","evidence_verified":false,"key":"magnitude","score":40},{"assessment":"Revises eligibility criteria for existing federal grant programs and requires a GAO report, with no direct spending appropriation stated.","evidence":"The Comptroller General of the United States shall... submit to the Congress a report","evidence_verified":false,"key":"fiscal","score":20},{"assessment":"Amends the Housing and Community Development Act of 1974 regarding income definitions and mandates a one-time GAO review across HUD programs.","evidence":"Section 102(a)(20) of the Housing and Community Development Act of 1974 (42 U.S.C. 5302(a)(20)) is amended","evidence_verified":true,"key":"scope","score":35},{"assessment":"Permanent change to CDBG eligibility determinations alongside a one-time GAO report requirement.","evidence":null,"evidence_verified":false,"key":"duration","score":75}],"missing_information":["Number of disabled veterans who will newly qualify for CDBG-funded assistance.","Cost to federal agencies of conducting the GAO review and reporting."],"rationale":"Excludes service-connected disability compensation from income calculations for determining eligibility under the Community Development Block Grant program and orders a GAO report on HUD programs.","score":45},"importance_meta":{"generated_at":"2026-10-26T06:19:38+00:00","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","source_basis":"text+summary","source_urls":["https://www.congress.gov/119/plaws/publ70/PLAW-119publ70.htm"]},"introduced_date":"2025-01-07","is_demo":false,"label":"H.R. 224","latest_action":{"date":"2026-01-20","text":"Became Public Law No: 119-70."},"members":[{"chamber":"House","district":"15","id":"D000594","name"